# Issue #5572: the advance claims an offset whose append has not returned or was
# never applied, so a capture over it can miss the entry and the GC trim it.
MODULE: WalDurability
ROW: LiveAdvance(l)
FILE: src/lattice/BPlusTree/LeafLiveAdvanceCore.cs
DETECTORS: BPlusLeafGrainTests.A_live_advance_waits_until_every_issued_append_is_applied, BPlusLeafGrainTests.A_failed_append_turns_the_live_advance_off_for_the_activation
SUMMARY: the live advance runs while an own append is issued but not yet applied

--- FIND
            && unappliedAppends == 0
--- REPLACE
            && unappliedAppends >= 0
--- END
